# dart:html Notification

`html.Notification(title, {dir, body, lang, tag, icon})` is the full constructor.

Do not pass JS NotificationOptions (`silent`, `badge`, `vibrate`, `requireInteraction`, `renotify`). Those compile on JS but **fail Dart Chrome compile** with `No named parameter with the name 'silent'`.

Create notifications only through `_createBrowserNotification` in `web_notification_web.dart`.
